### MIMIT API (Italy)
### Open data fuel stations and prices (CSV format)
### Docs: https://www.mimit.gov.it/index.php/it/open-data/elenco-dataset/carburanti-prezzi-praticati-e-anagrafica-impianti

@baseUrl = https://www.mimit.gov.it/images/exportCSV

### Get active stations registry (CSV)
GET {{baseUrl}}/anagrafica_impianti_attivi.csv
Accept: text/csv

> {%
    client.test("Request executed successfully", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "Response status is not 200");
    });
%}

### Get latest daily prices (CSV)
GET {{baseUrl}}/prezzo_alle_8.csv
Accept: text/csv

> {%
    client.test("Request executed successfully", function() {
